h under that new banner is aimed squarely at the European trekking ebike market.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/bicycles/mapfour-roam-trekking-ebike/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/bicycles/\">Bicycles</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/transport/\">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/ebikes/\" rel=\"tag\">ebikes</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/pedal-assisted/\" rel=\"tag\">Pedal-assisted</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/touring/\" rel=\"tag\">Touring</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/bikepacking/\" rel=\"tag\">Bikepacking</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/security/\" rel=\"tag\">Security</a></p>",
